# Recorder smoke test (docs/recording.md): a title card, an orbit around the Eye T1 rig,
# the Eye's GUI, an end card. About 25 s of video.

# setup (never recorded)
build eye
time day

scene title
  card 3 Beyond the Stars | Recorder smoke test | recorded in a GTNH 2.9 dev client

scene eye-orbit
  caption Eye of Harmony, tier 1: built by its kit in a fresh creative world and wired with redstone and GT covers
  orbit eye+0,-6,-10 radius 75 height 28 from -40 to 40 seconds 14

scene eye-gui
  caption The Eye's controller screen: what the star is doing, the field gauges and the last event
  goto eyectrl+0,0.2,-3.5 look eyectrl
  gui eyectrl
  hold 4
  close

scene end
  card 3 End of the smoke test | Full showcase to follow
